# Deploy On Explicit Request

- If the user explicitly asks to update/deploy/publish the site, run:
  - `C:\Users\shink\Desktop\AVITOLOG-CLAUDE\update_site.bat`
- Do **not** run deploy automatically after every code change.
- Treat phrases like `обнови сайт`, `запусти update_site.bat`, `задеплой` as explicit deploy requests.
- After running, report key results briefly:
  - pull status
  - commit hash/message (if created)
  - push status
- If the script waits for keypress (`Press any key to close...`), terminate that waiting process safely.
